**/license_admin.json
**/license_public.json
**/license_records.txt
**/tg_verify.json
**/ui_locale.json
**/ui_column_widths.json
**/*restore_result*.json
**/*.csv

# 打包与备份
**/dist/
**/build/
**/backup/
**/backups/
**/*.bak
**/*.bak_*

# IDE / 本地
.cursor/
.qoder/
**/.cursor/
